            <ArticleTitle>Epidural analgesia. Your role.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>53-7; quiz 58</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For postoperative pain, epidural analgesia may be the most effective medicine. But there are a few things nurses need to know about managing the patient, including the early warning signs of complications and what to do--and what not to do--if they occur.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
